WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by fofiko1 and Rémi

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:10.367
Be happy... Be happy, Candy!

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:15.011
Or else I will not forgive you!

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:19.175
Terry, you too.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:22.603
In order to forget Terry,

00:00:22.793 --> 00:00:29.656
Candy decided to volunteer to
the mobile hospital in the mountains.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:38.500
The cross on Pony's Hill.

00:01:05.966 --> 00:01:08.196
Chicago is getting
farther and farther away.

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:10.764
Good bye,
Mr. Albert, Archie and Annie.

00:01:11.138 --> 00:01:14.339
There are many people waiting for me
in the mountains.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.981
Excuse me.

00:02:03.131 --> 00:02:05.518
Miss, is this seat taken?

00:02:07.561 --> 00:02:10.622
Now I feel relieved.
It's very dangerous to take the train!

00:02:10.772 --> 00:02:12.562
Dangerous! Be careful!

00:02:14.301 --> 00:02:16.428
Nonsense!

00:02:16.578 --> 00:02:20.564
My grandson taught him that.
He's very naughty.

00:02:20.774 --> 00:02:22.674
I can't stand it!

00:02:25.212 --> 00:02:27.840
Don't laugh, idiot! Be serious!

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:38.414
Watch out! Make way!

00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:47.692
Madam, are you OK?

00:02:47.842 --> 00:02:50.798
It's terrible!
That's why I hate trains!

00:02:54.374 --> 00:02:56.535
Get out of the way!

00:02:57.711 --> 00:03:01.977
Move! Don't get on my way!

00:03:02.582 --> 00:03:03.742
Stop!

00:03:03.892 --> 00:03:07.119
This land was reclaimed by us
at the very beginning!

00:03:07.921 --> 00:03:10.647
What? Are you against
the development of the railways?

00:03:11.358 --> 00:03:14.619
Wait a minute. You can beat me,
but who's going to graze the cows?

00:03:16.763 --> 00:03:19.057
The passengers must be tired.

00:03:19.207 --> 00:03:22.431
Sorry, everyone,
there's a 15 minute delay.

00:03:22.602 --> 00:03:24.591
You can get out of the train
and walk around if you like.

00:03:24.741 --> 00:03:27.400
Sitting for such a long time
is bad for your health.

00:03:27.841 --> 00:03:30.101
Tom? Is that you, Tom?

00:03:30.251 --> 00:03:33.612
Candy, it's you!

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.273
I'd never imagined
we would meet in such a place!

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.150
Do those cows that are blocking
the railway belong to your family?

00:03:39.303 --> 00:03:41.146
We're going back to our farm
right now.

00:03:41.396 --> 00:03:44.916
You are really good!
You can graze so many cows alone.

00:03:45.066 --> 00:03:47.289
That's because
I have a good assistant.

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.563
Mina!

00:03:52.499 --> 00:03:53.491
It's cold!

00:03:53.641 --> 00:03:57.327
I went to Pony's Home
and asked Mina to give me a hand.

00:03:58.104 --> 00:03:59.364
Pony's Home?

00:03:59.514 --> 00:04:02.131
Candy, you are going there, right?

00:04:02.943 --> 00:04:04.274
No.

00:04:04.477 --> 00:04:06.611
Then why are you on this train?

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:10.605
Move the cows quickly!

00:04:19.993 --> 00:04:22.188
Mina, it's on you,
take your time.

00:04:26.366 --> 00:04:28.596
The railway construction site
in Graytown ?

00:04:28.902 --> 00:04:29.994
Please don't go there, Candy.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.530
I've heard that it's like hell there.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:35.199
- Hell?
- Life is very hard in the mountains.

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:39.401
There are many gangsters there.

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:41.373
That's great!

00:04:41.523 --> 00:04:43.211
You must be joking!

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:45.844
Listen to me!
Get back to where you came from.

00:04:45.994 --> 00:04:47.779
Tom, I made up my mind.

00:04:47.929 --> 00:04:51.116
I've heard about all these rumours.
That's why I am going.

00:04:51.266 --> 00:04:52.954
This is my first mission.

00:04:53.393 --> 00:04:56.454
I was told many patients are
waiting for me there.

00:04:56.604 --> 00:04:57.621
Candy...

00:04:59.199 --> 00:05:03.808
Please get on the train,
we will continue our journey.

00:05:03.958 --> 00:05:07.365
Tom, I'm so pleased to have seen you.

00:05:07.515 --> 00:05:09.868
Please say hello to Sister Pony
and Sister Lane for me.

00:05:10.018 --> 00:05:13.003
Tell them that I am fine
and I will try my best.

00:05:15.115 --> 00:05:16.541
Candy, in fact...

00:05:16.691 --> 00:05:17.844
What?

00:05:18.151 --> 00:05:21.308
I am afraid to tell you
what happened to Sister Pony.

00:05:21.508 --> 00:05:23.813
What happened to Sister Pony?

00:05:24.257 --> 00:05:25.925
She's not feeling very well.

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:28.320
What do you mean by that?

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:29.621
Well, she is not getting younger.

00:05:29.771 --> 00:05:31.664
Is Sister Pony sick?

00:05:32.799 --> 00:05:34.596
What kind of illness
does she have?

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:36.861
She has high blood pressure, yes!

00:05:37.011 --> 00:05:40.565
She was ill before I left.
The doctor asked her to get some rest.

00:05:40.807 --> 00:05:43.768
High blood pressure?
That's terrible!

00:05:43.918 --> 00:05:47.372
Sister Pony is getting older. She
might be in danger with this condition.

00:05:47.522 --> 00:05:50.139
Why did you want to hide
such an important thing from me?

00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:52.243
I don't know...

00:05:52.393 --> 00:05:58.086
What should I do? The patients
in Graytown are waiting for me.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:02.528
But I am worried about Sister Pony.

00:06:04.064 --> 00:06:06.498
How far is it from here
to Pony's Home?

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.164
If you take a horse, you could
get there before dark.

00:06:09.436 --> 00:06:12.200
You can go to my farm
to get a horse.

00:06:13.306 --> 00:06:16.101
We're leaving! Hurry up!

00:06:16.251 --> 00:06:17.643
Let's go.

00:06:17.811 --> 00:06:19.506
What about your job?

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:22.555
I can get back after that.
I guess I can return on time.

00:06:22.705 --> 00:06:24.877
Ok. Let's get your luggage.

00:06:25.819 --> 00:06:30.048
America is small!
You can meet friends even here.

00:06:30.198 --> 00:06:31.282
Take care, grandma.

00:06:31.432 --> 00:06:35.286
Thanks to your friend,
we got some resting time.

00:06:35.436 --> 00:06:37.386
Goodbye!

00:06:43.803 --> 00:06:45.270
Get on!

00:06:59.119 --> 00:07:00.814
Don't be so serious.

00:07:01.654 --> 00:07:03.053
All right, Candy?

00:07:03.356 --> 00:07:07.948
Sister Pony watched me growing up.
I can't hide anything from her.

00:07:08.098 --> 00:07:11.356
You're right.
Some things never change.

00:07:11.506 --> 00:07:14.859
But, we are growing up.

00:07:15.009 --> 00:07:17.960
Sister Pony is not young anymore.

00:07:23.076 --> 00:07:26.872
I can't imagine
Sister Pony would leave us someday.

00:07:27.981 --> 00:07:30.472
- Candy...
- I will do my best to take care of her.

00:07:31.017 --> 00:07:33.281
I will work hard.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.234
- Take it easy.
- Thank you.

00:07:50.537 --> 00:07:52.364
I will go to see her tomorrow.

00:07:56.242 --> 00:07:58.036
I am lucky I ran into Tom.

00:07:58.186 --> 00:08:01.046
Or, I wouldn't get to know
that Sister Pony is sick.

00:08:01.247 --> 00:08:03.875
I've been in many places before.

00:08:25.405 --> 00:08:28.397
Now I am almost there!

00:08:39.252 --> 00:08:42.688
I miss Pony's Home so much!
Things haven't changed at all.

00:08:42.889 --> 00:08:45.323
Sister Pony!

00:09:03.076 --> 00:09:04.543
Sister Pony...

00:09:07.747 --> 00:09:10.511
Sister Pony rests here.

00:09:15.054 --> 00:09:17.579
Why?

00:09:28.901 --> 00:09:32.359
Sister Pony!

00:09:32.905 --> 00:09:35.396
Mother!

00:10:23.323 --> 00:10:26.349
Candy, is that you, Candy?

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:30.157
Sister Lane... Sister Lane!

00:10:30.763 --> 00:10:33.630
Sister Pony... Sister Pony!

00:10:36.235 --> 00:10:38.396
What's wrong, Candy?

00:10:38.705 --> 00:10:42.634
That's not fair!
How could Sister Pony die?

00:10:42.784 --> 00:10:45.136
Candy, what are you talking about?

00:10:45.286 --> 00:10:47.672
Why didn't you tell me?

00:10:47.822 --> 00:10:51.376
I disappointed Sister Pony...

00:10:52.118 --> 00:10:54.018
What are you talking about, Candy?

00:10:54.387 --> 00:10:56.180
Why didn't you tell me?

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:57.649
Candy, calm down.

00:10:57.799 --> 00:10:59.954
How can I calm down
in such circumstances?

00:11:04.364 --> 00:11:06.696
Oh, the cross!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.899
I am sorry about this, Candy.
Sister Pony isn't dead!

00:11:12.472 --> 00:11:14.332
That's Bob's joke.

00:11:14.482 --> 00:11:15.366
Bob?

00:11:15.516 --> 00:11:18.274
He's new here.
And he's got a weird temper.

00:11:18.711 --> 00:11:23.270
When he's not happy,
he makes graves for people.

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:25.509
I see...

00:11:26.018 --> 00:11:28.845
He wants to curse Pony's Home.

00:11:28.995 --> 00:11:30.960
Look. He's got his spelling wrong.

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:33.957
I can't forgive him
for this nasty joke!

00:11:35.361 --> 00:11:37.352
Candy, wait for me!

00:11:41.734 --> 00:11:45.030
Candy, you're back!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.265
Where's Bob?

00:11:47.415 --> 00:11:49.702
- He's in the back room.
- Thank you.

00:11:56.816 --> 00:11:58.511
Are you Bob?

00:11:58.851 --> 00:12:00.244
Yes.

00:12:00.394 --> 00:12:03.978
You went too far
on your little mischief.

00:12:04.824 --> 00:12:06.284
What do you want?

00:12:06.434 --> 00:12:08.726
I will teach you a lesson.

00:12:09.962 --> 00:12:11.793
Oh really? How?

00:12:12.231 --> 00:12:13.624
Stand up.

00:12:13.774 --> 00:12:15.132
No!

00:12:16.569 --> 00:12:18.129
I said "stand up", Bob!

00:12:18.279 --> 00:12:19.967
You're so annoying!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:21.966
What are you doing?

00:12:22.116 --> 00:12:24.800
Sister Pony is the mother
of all of us.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.637
Don't you ever dare to curse her!

00:12:26.787 --> 00:12:28.441
How dare you beat me?

00:12:29.482 --> 00:12:32.576
You're such a mean girl!
Watch out!

00:12:36.322 --> 00:12:39.553
Stop! That's not the most pleasant thing
to do when you're finally back!

00:12:39.859 --> 00:12:41.417
Stop! Bob!

00:12:41.928 --> 00:12:44.292
God, you are hurt!

00:12:45.465 --> 00:12:48.332
I'm a nurse and still being
taken care of by others.

00:12:49.702 --> 00:12:51.929
You are still so impulsive, Candy!

00:12:52.079 --> 00:12:55.496
Candy, you always frighten us.

00:12:56.275 --> 00:12:59.267
But it's Bob's fault.

00:13:00.179 --> 00:13:04.075
It's really weird to make a grave
for people who are still alive.

00:13:04.225 --> 00:13:06.077
Why don't you punish him?

00:13:06.227 --> 00:13:10.109
When Bob came here,
he couldn't read.

00:13:10.259 --> 00:13:11.749
At this age?

00:13:11.899 --> 00:13:16.152
His father drinks all day and
does not allow him to go to school.

00:13:16.929 --> 00:13:20.126
But the writing on the cross
is beautiful.

00:13:20.366 --> 00:13:24.660
The other kids always made fun of him
because he couldn't read.

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:26.761
What's this?

00:13:32.678 --> 00:13:34.739
What are you doing, Bob?

00:13:35.189 --> 00:13:36.908
I'm making Jim's cross.

00:13:37.058 --> 00:13:39.952
Jim makes me feel like a fool.

00:13:40.186 --> 00:13:43.917
Bob, if there's no name on it,
nobody will know whose cross it is!

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:46.119
That's right.

00:13:50.429 --> 00:13:52.190
Bob has been practicing
writing since then.

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:56.497
He can write now.

00:13:59.505 --> 00:14:01.799
No wonder you're not mad at him.

00:14:01.949 --> 00:14:05.168
When he's angry, he learns
how to write the name of that person.

00:14:05.318 --> 00:14:09.387
Sometimes, he makes spelling mistakes.
But he's almost learnt them all.

00:14:09.537 --> 00:14:12.377
Candy, why did you come by horse?

00:14:12.527 --> 00:14:15.913
Right, I almost forgot
the most important thing.

00:14:16.063 --> 00:14:18.582
Are you better, Sister Pony?

00:14:21.093 --> 00:14:22.687
Open your mouth.

00:14:22.837 --> 00:14:24.889
- Open my mouth?
- Hurry!

00:14:25.039 --> 00:14:25.990
Why, Candy?

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:29.564
Just listen to what Candy says.

00:14:32.371 --> 00:14:35.939
Your throat is ok.
Now show me your tongue.

00:14:36.542 --> 00:14:39.048
- Candy!
- Like this?

00:14:39.198 --> 00:14:42.409
Your liver is fine, too.
Now let's check your pulse.

00:14:42.782 --> 00:14:44.308
You can put your tongue
back in your mouth!

00:14:44.458 --> 00:14:49.113
I can't remember when was the last time
I had put out my tongue!

00:14:49.263 --> 00:14:51.122
Your pulse is good.

00:14:51.457 --> 00:14:53.401
Excuse me.
Do you mind taking off your clothes?

00:14:53.601 --> 00:14:55.807
You want me naked?

00:14:56.237 --> 00:14:58.756
Candy, what do you want to do?

00:14:58.906 --> 00:15:02.858
Don't be shy.
I am a professional nurse!

00:15:03.369 --> 00:15:07.237
But why are you examining me?

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:10.134
Isn't Sister Pony ill?

00:15:10.284 --> 00:15:12.303
Who told you that?

00:15:12.453 --> 00:15:15.418
- Tom.
- You saw Tom?

00:15:15.568 --> 00:15:17.441
So he lied to me?

00:15:17.591 --> 00:15:19.347
You're right, Candy.

00:15:19.719 --> 00:15:23.548
Why did he say I am ill?

00:15:23.698 --> 00:15:26.951
That's terrible.
Why did he lie to me?

00:15:27.101 --> 00:15:31.055
You're wrong, Candy.
We should be grateful to him.

00:15:31.205 --> 00:15:34.574
He said I was sick on purpose,
so that we could meet again!

00:15:34.724 --> 00:15:36.503
I agree, Candy!

00:15:36.693 --> 00:15:38.062
That's right.

00:15:38.212 --> 00:15:41.899
It makes sense. Sister Pony, Sister Lane,
I am thankful to Tom for his white lie.

00:15:42.149 --> 00:15:44.702
Sister Lane, show it to her.

00:15:44.852 --> 00:15:46.301
Yes.

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:55.251
That's the gift Sister Pony
has collected for you.

00:15:56.489 --> 00:15:57.956
What's this?

00:16:02.128 --> 00:16:06.628
- Terry...
- He is already a famous actor now.

00:16:06.808 --> 00:16:09.866
Sister Pony is a huge fan of Terry.

00:16:16.475 --> 00:16:17.737
Candy?

00:16:18.811 --> 00:16:20.611
I am sorry.

00:16:20.721 --> 00:16:23.641
Candy, did anything happen to Terrius?

00:16:23.791 --> 00:16:27.342
We broke up.

00:16:30.389 --> 00:16:32.333
Sorry to make you upset.

00:16:32.483 --> 00:16:35.120
No. It's been quite a long time.

00:16:39.165 --> 00:16:40.262
Kurin!

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.790
Excuse me!

00:16:45.071 --> 00:16:48.040
Kurin, have you found a new girlfriend?

00:16:48.541 --> 00:16:50.099
I missed you so much!

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:56.741
Candy seems upset.

00:16:56.891 --> 00:16:59.944
Yes. The reason Tom claimed that
I was sick is because he realized

00:17:00.094 --> 00:17:04.217
there's something wrong with Candy.
That's why he made her come back.

00:17:04.623 --> 00:17:09.856
Candy looks fine on the surface,
but Tom really understands her.

00:17:17.369 --> 00:17:18.961
Is everyone seated?

00:17:19.538 --> 00:17:21.632
Ready for the meal!

00:17:21.782 --> 00:17:23.868
Candy, Bob is not here.

00:17:24.543 --> 00:17:26.340
He shouldn't have done that.

00:17:26.812 --> 00:17:28.309
I will look for him.

00:17:35.721 --> 00:17:36.983
It's done!

00:17:39.625 --> 00:17:41.593
Why are you still here?.

00:17:42.128 --> 00:17:43.390
Candy!

00:17:43.562 --> 00:17:47.089
Are you making a cross again?
Who are you putting a curse on this time?

00:17:47.967 --> 00:17:49.662
Look.

00:17:51.737 --> 00:17:55.099
Freckled girl rests here.
It's for me?

00:17:55.249 --> 00:17:56.467
Yes.

00:17:56.617 --> 00:17:58.569
Thank you for the cross.

00:17:58.719 --> 00:18:01.875
But my name is Candice White.

00:18:02.281 --> 00:18:03.408
That's too complicated.

00:18:03.658 --> 00:18:06.911
You carved it as if it was printed!

00:18:07.586 --> 00:18:09.246
Don't flatter me.

00:18:09.396 --> 00:18:13.884
I am not flattering you!
Oh, can I make a request?

00:18:14.034 --> 00:18:15.290
A request?

00:18:32.511 --> 00:18:35.446
Who's still in the woodshed?

00:18:39.585 --> 00:18:42.012
Bob, are you making a cross?

00:18:42.162 --> 00:18:43.516
No, Sister. It's a signboard!

00:18:46.592 --> 00:18:48.719
The Graytown Clinic.

00:18:48.869 --> 00:18:50.621
The freckled girl asked me to do that.

00:18:50.897 --> 00:18:53.124
Yes, I did.
I'm leaving tomorrow morning.

00:18:53.274 --> 00:18:57.594
I guess there won't be any signboard
in the mountains.

00:18:57.744 --> 00:19:01.565
We are not worried about the signboard.

00:19:01.715 --> 00:19:05.236
Candy, please don't go to Graytown.

00:19:05.386 --> 00:19:09.440
Yes. I've heard from local people here...

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:13.501
It's an awful place,
especially for a young woman.

00:19:13.761 --> 00:19:15.980
I know that.
But I have made up my mind.

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:18.115
Candy.

00:19:18.265 --> 00:19:19.650
Candy, is it because of Terry?

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:23.854
No. Terry has nothing to do with this.

00:19:24.004 --> 00:19:27.695
I am sent there by the St. Joanna
Hospital from Chicago.

00:19:27.933 --> 00:19:29.127
Candy.

00:19:29.535 --> 00:19:31.228
My poor Candy...

00:19:31.378 --> 00:19:33.771
Sister Pony, Sister Lane...

00:19:34.506 --> 00:19:36.066
Sister Pony is crying.

00:19:36.216 --> 00:19:38.667
Sister Lane is also crying for me.

00:19:44.817 --> 00:19:47.911
Thank you so much,
Sister Pony, Sister Lane.

00:19:48.454 --> 00:19:52.082
Nurses are needed in that area.
That's why I must go.

00:19:52.232 --> 00:19:54.125
Because I am a nurse.

00:19:55.294 --> 00:19:58.730
Friends of mine were willing to take
a risk in the European battlefields.

00:19:58.964 --> 00:20:01.159
My sacrifice is nothing
compared to that.

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:03.294
I understand.

00:20:03.444 --> 00:20:06.827
We worry too much.

00:20:07.806 --> 00:20:09.900
But it will be very hard, Candy.

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:15.311
No, my sacrifice can't be compared
to what you two have done.

00:20:15.514 --> 00:20:17.209
We do hard work?

00:20:18.017 --> 00:20:21.414
Taking care of kids all the time
with no regrets and complaints.

00:20:22.154 --> 00:20:28.150
No! Children are a gift from God!

00:20:30.562 --> 00:20:31.956
Bob, what's wrong?

00:20:32.106 --> 00:20:35.489
I am sorry, Sister Pony, Sister Lane...

00:20:36.201 --> 00:20:37.294
Bob...

00:20:37.444 --> 00:20:42.333
I put a curse on you... I...

00:20:42.483 --> 00:20:45.536
Bob, we were not hurt from this.

00:20:45.686 --> 00:20:48.439
You will be a good person someday.

00:20:48.589 --> 00:20:52.314
And Candy will be
a good mother and wife.

00:20:52.885 --> 00:20:55.547
- That's right.
- Sister...

00:20:59.024 --> 00:21:03.324
The cold wind blows in Pony's Home
through the cracks on the wall.

00:21:03.495 --> 00:21:07.695
But Candy feels as warm
as sitting next to a stove.

00:21:08.667 --> 00:21:11.727
After breaking up with Terry,

00:21:11.937 --> 00:21:17.898
the coldness in her heart is going
farther and farther away.
